## Objectives

The main objectives for Day 53 were:

- Build PDF resume extraction
- Build DOCX resume extraction
- Clean extracted text
- Validate uploaded files
- Handle parsing errors gracefully
- Integrate parsing with Flask
- Verify extraction using a sample resume

